  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using transformer aggregation and weighted fusion with scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders (config_024) achieves high accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with pca_n2000 while keeping other components the same isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice. It directly addresses uncertainty about which RNA encoder (scvi_n200 vs pca_n2000) is more effective in this setup, a critical design decision with potential to improve performance."
